<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-EASTERN PROVINCE 108-2 V INDIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-EASTERN PROVINCE 108-2 V INDIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH, South Africa 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province were 108-2 in reply to India's first innings of 335-6 declared when rain forced an early close on the second day of their three-day match at St Georges Park on Sunday.</p>
</text>
